*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0040
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-17 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 619
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0040.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
    05 T-AMT1             PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> ORIGIN COUNTRY CODE
    05 WS-CTRY            PIC X(2).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 WS-RVF             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHECK-TXN
    DISPLAY "WS-RVF=" WS-RVF
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-TXN.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR
    IF C-AG-YY < 18
       AND T-AMT1 GREATER THAN 2000.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-RVF
    END-IF.
